  "junk_candidates_for_removal": {
    "_comment": "Tags that carry no descriptive content. Routed to removedTags. Includes: (1) jam/event/week names, (2) bare dates, (3) author/character handles, (4) model & platform meta, (5) joke tags, (6) invented world/series/universe/setting names (e.g. 'eltaraseries', 'crestfalltown', 'drakonia', 'thesunderedstars') - a private fictional setting says nothing about what a card is like, (7) POV/perspective tags (deliberately dropped - never meaningfully filterable), (8) body/appearance attributes (Tall, Short, Athletic, Big Breasts, Curvy, hair color, etc. - these describe text-only cards and most platforms disallow them). NOTE: holiday-dated tags like 'christmas2024'/'valentine2025' are NOT junk - they map to the Holiday category.",
